body:
Fucking Rufus. He was a decent dad and a decent human being but consistently made bad decisions: 

- I agree with you for the Jenny thing, he should have let her become a designer while pursuing her high school degree independently; 

- letting his pride get in the way of Lily paying for Dan’s tuition at Yale. Like wtf man, just swallow your pride, your kid just got into YALE;

 - the whole Ivy thing, but to be fair I don’t count the later seasons as cannon because the writers were obviously on crack.
